arı afvolasınız ve ecrinizi alasınız.</p><p>Lâkin bu afvi İlâhîye kimlerin nâil olabileceğini iyi anlamak lâzım gelir şöyle ki: <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"441\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 440.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 18.0 18.0 24.7 24.7 24.7 32.3 39.0 39.0 54.7 54.7 65.3 81.0 91.6 99.7 99.7 108.7 115.6 115.6 123.0 123.0 129.7 147.0 147.0 153.7 153.7 160.6 171.7 171.7 180.0 197.3 197.3 204.0 204.0 204.0 210.7 218.3 225.0 225.0 240.7 251.3 259.6 259.6 267.0 267.0 273.7 273.7 285.7 301.6 312.0 318.7 318.7 327.7 327.7 335.3 351.0 351.0 361.6 361.6 377.3 390.7 402.0 413.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"32.3 65.3 81.0 129.7 160.6 180.0 240.7 285.7 301.6 327.7 351.0 424.6\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 20.3 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg></p>"}